{"schema_version":"nollm_access_statement_v1","statement":{"content_utf8":"Stitch 保持有向格联系，CLI 已能按连接 ID 读回\nC1 的共享项目 API 仍把两个当前 Statement 的物理格作为有向 Bridge 端点，权重 32768、单步、单目标；connected recall 才允许 bridge。目标格同格其他表达可能随桥返回；原位修订不自动撤桥，语义条件由 Host 保留在正文并决定何时 unstitch。project 与 em 的 CLI 现在都分派 links，可读全体当前原生桥或按原 link ID 查询，回源和维护不必改建外置关系索引。","context_refs":["e0e0dd80039d129b7a0321e1e640ffa0c987f9eb:lab/nollm-lab/repository_memory/project_memory.py#L73-L97","e0e0dd80039d129b7a0321e1e640ffa0c987f9eb:lab/nollm-lab/repository_memory/project_memory.py#L149-L159","e0e0dd80039d129b7a0321e1e640ffa0c987f9eb:lab/nollm-lab/repository_memory/project_memory.py#L206-L213","e0e0dd80039d129b7a0321e1e640ffa0c987f9eb:packages/nollm-core/src/nollm_core/recall.py#L132-L137","e0e0dd80039d129b7a0321e1e640ffa0c987f9eb:packages/nollm-access/src/nollm_access/runtime.py#L190-L213","revises:nollm.stitch.v1"],"source_handle":"e0e0dd80039d129b7a0321e1e640ffa0c987f9eb:lab/nollm-lab/repository_memory/project_memory.py#L18-L23","statement_id":"nollm.stitch.v2"}}
